link: Wiz Research, the compromised key | https://www.wiz.io/blog/storm-0558-compromised-microsoft-key-enables-authentication-of-countless-micr
link: Wiz Research, key takeaways | https://www.wiz.io/blog/key-takeaways-from-microsofts-latest-storm-0558-report
